      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If VRChat kept a record of how many times it had seen hashes, but not which accounts the hashes belonged to, that might be safe, but then if you ever deleted your account and tried to make a new one you'd be detected as a reuse and potentially prevented from reverifying.",
